{"$schema":"../../schema/vectors.schema.json","format":1,"area":"format","name":"icu-overrides","description":"Money formatted as currency in the locales where ICU's shipped data overrides CLDR's (fr-CH's group separator), every display and sign; the text and its parts.","provenance":{"source":"cldr","generator":{"name":"scripts/gen-format-vectors.py","version":"1"},"method":"The same formatter and parser as the cldr files (scripts/gen-format-vectors.py), with the number symbols ICU 78.3's shipped locale data sets where it deliberately overrides CLDR 48 applied on top: icu4c/source/data/locales/<locale>.txt at tag release-78.3 of unicode-org/icu, copied to data/icu/ (data/icu/README.md). A survey of ICU 78.3's symbols, number patterns and currency patterns against CLDR 48 for every locale tag here and its parent chain found one override: fr_CH.txt (lines 10-13) sets group \"'\", where CLDR 48's fr_CH.xml (tag release-48, lines 215-217) inherits fr's U+202F. TR35 doesn't define formatToParts: here the number's digits, separators and signs are the integer, group, decimal, fraction and minusSign parts, the symbol or name is the currency part, bidi marks (format characters) in a symbol are literals, and every other pattern character, including currency spacing, is a literal; adjacent characters of one type merge. That convention, and how a currency name is shown (the number in the decimal pattern with the currency's separators, never in the accounting form, then unitPattern with the name in the number's plural form), were settled after looking at ICU's output, so agreement on them is not independent evidence; the text of every other row is.","data":{"cldr":"48.0","icu":"78.3","iso4217":"2026-09-17","runtimeIntl":"every row: ducat formats and parses with the runtime's Intl (ICU 78.3, CLDR 48 on Node 24 and Bun); an engine with other CLDR data writes other text; these rows also need ICU's own locale data, which overrides CLDR's","referenceRuntime":"Node 24 (ICU 78.3, CLDR 48.0)"}},"checkedAgainst":"0.4.0","contentSha256":"602dfc2fa169dfabf20a74d68f1565ca1c91030f2991ff781dc1196b3e58fd13","tables":[
